{"event_id": "7", "type": "speak", "sender": "2", "sender_name": "王警官", "sender_role": "Policeman", "content": {"text": "主持人，我打断一下。Lily的思路有方向性，但X-9的质疑很关键。‘房间’这个词需要明确——是普通居室、控制室还是其他功能性空间？醉酒男人是偶然进入还是有意进入？关灯是手动开关还是切断电源？死亡方式是撞击、坠落还是其他？我需要这些基础事实才能判断灯塔假设是否成立。"}, "references": [{"event_id": "3", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "5", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "4", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "6", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "1", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "2", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}], "tags": ["事实核查", "空间关系", "情境设定", "逻辑推理", "因果关联", "死亡性质", "证据链构建", "行为动机分析", "场景功能界定"], "metadata": {"agent_expertise": ["evidence", "logic"]}, "timestamp": "2026-01-11T15:11:08.267429+00:00"}
{"event_id": "8", "type": "speak", "sender": "3", "sender_name": "Lily", "sender_role": "LittleGirl", "content": {"text": "那我问问吧！那个死掉的人，他死的时候眼睛是睁着的还是闭着的？他是不是在等什么信号？"}, "references": [{"event_id": "1", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "3", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "4", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "5", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "6", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "2", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "7", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}], "tags": ["情境谜题", "假设验证", "故事还原", "角色代入", "逻辑推理", "因果关联", "死亡状态", "信号等待", "目击细节"], "metadata": {"agent_expertise": ["imagination", "wild_guess"]}, "timestamp": "2026-01-11T15:11:28.207111+00:00"}
{"event_id": "9", "type": "speak", "sender": "4", "sender_name": "X-9", "sender_role": "AlienRobot", "content": {"text": "Lily的问题‘眼睛睁着还是闭着’与‘是否在等信号’属于主观推断，缺乏逻辑必要性。死亡状态与信号等待无法直接验证关灯与死亡的因果机制。建议优先验证客观事实：关灯是否导致可见光消失？死者是否依赖该光源进行导航或操作？房间是否为控制室或信号站？醉酒者是否知晓其行为后果？"}, "references": [{"event_id": "1", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "2", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "3", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "4", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "5", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "6", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "7", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}, {"event_id": "8", "weight": {"stance": 0.1, "inspiration": 0.1, "dependency": 0.1}}], "tags": ["逻辑推理", "事实核查", "因果关联", "情境谜题", "行为动机分析", "场景功能界定", "证据链构建", "行为后果评估", "环境依赖性分析"], "metadata": {"agent_expertise": ["logic", "probability"]}, "timestamp": "2026-01-11T15:11:48.634280+00:00"}
